# What this port keeps beside itself when it is launched from here: the four
# play-*.cmd pin VF3_DATA to the project folder, so its settings, NVRAM, log,
# the player's own portraits and their replacement textures land here and must
# not be committed. The dumps and the packs are made from the player's own ROM
# and never belong in the repository either.
/settings.ini
/settings.ini.tmp
/log.txt
/backup
/backup-*
/eeprom
/eeprom-*
/portraits-*/
/texture_replacement*/
/texture_remplacement*/
assets-hd/
/captures-honey/

# The console menu's pictures: they come in part from the game, so out of the repository.
/assets/menu-console/

# The texture captures, timestamped: pictures from the game, out of the repository.
/captures-textures-honey/

# The full texture dump: pictures from the game, out of the repository.
/Textures3D-dump*/
/Textures3D-aplats/

# From upstream: Wrangler's cache and the neighbouring ports checked out beside this one.
.wrangler/
/*-recomp/

# the measurement WAVs: made by vf3run --wav and by the harnesses, never a source
*.wav
